OL,3,GNEWSAChinook helicopter lands in field
OL,4,Aafter bird strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA military helicopter has made an
OL,7,Femergency landing in a field after a
OL,8,Fbird strike during a routine training
OL,9,Fflight.
OL,11,FThe Royal Air Force (RAF) said the
OL,12,FChinook helicopter, which had flown
OL,13,Ffrom RAF Odiham in Hampshire, landed in
OL,14,Fa field near the A4 in Pewsham,
OL,15,FWiltshire, earlier as a precautionary
OL,16,Fmeasure.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the RAF said the
OL,19,Fcrew on board were not injured and an
OL,20,Fengineering team from the helicopter's
OL,21,Fbase had been dispatched to assess the
OL,22,Fdamage to the aircraft.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
