OL,3,GNEWSAChinook helicopter lands in field
OL,4,Aafter bird strike
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We would like to thank the landowners
OL,7,Ffor their patience and assistance
OL,8,Fwhilst we look to rectify the
OL,9,Faircraft," the spokesperson said.
